  "identifier": "openemr",
  "name": "OpenEMR",
  "description": "The most widely used open-source electronic health records (EHR) and medical practice management solution, governed by the OpenEMR Foundation, Inc. ONC Certified as of Version 8 (February 2026), confirming compliance with US federal health IT standards. Features advanced scheduling, electronic prescribing, HIPAA ASC X12 Version 5010 compliant billing, lab integration with automated result importing, a clinical decision support rules engine, CMS reporting, and fine-grained access controls. Supports FHIR interoperability and 30+ languages. Available as self-hosted, cloud-deployed, or free hosted for US-based providers. In production at International Planned Parenthood Federation, Peace Corps, and Siaya District Hospital among others. GPL-3.0 licensed, PHP-based, Docker-ready.",
  "url": "https://open-emr.org/",
