  "mach:judgement": "Adopt",
  "mach:judgementReason": "The most popular open-source EHR by community size (5.1k stars, 2.9k forks), ONC Certified as of Version 8 (February 2026), and production-proven at international scale — International Planned Parenthood Federation, Peace Corps, and Siaya District Hospital among others. Foundation-governed (OpenEMR Foundation, Inc.), GPL-3.0, FHIR-integrated, and HIPAA billing compliant. Complements OpenMRS in the MACH catalog: OpenEMR is the reference choice for US practice management and ONC compliance; OpenMRS is the reference for LMIC and modular concept-driven deployments.",
